{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"forge_l2","model_identifier":"forge_l2","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# forge_l2\n\nBloomery (forge level 2): a squat clay furnace tower with a tapping arch, big leather bellows on a frame, a stone smithy shed with anvil.\n\n- Footprint: 7 x 6 columns (112 x 96 units, 3.15 x 2.70 m), centred on the origin, front (door side) faces -Z.\n- Finished bounds: x -48..48, y 0..76, z -40..42 units.\n- Texture: 256 x 256, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering. Every visible face has its own texture region painted with its material at world position (seams line up across faces); identical faces share a region; construction and ruined pieces map into the region of the face they were cut from. No cube is cut to fit the texture.\n- Cubes: finished 32, construction_0 28, construction_33 28, construction_66 32, ruined 28 (6 rotated: roof slabs and a few leaning props).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- furnace: 32 x 68 x 32 at x -14, z 0\n- shed: 88 x 76 x 22 at z 29\n\n## State group sets (children of `root`; show exactly one)\n\n- `finished`: the finished building (visible by default).\n- `construction_0`, `construction_33`, `construction_66`: build progress at 0 %, 33 % and 66 % (staked outline and scaffold, then walls rising inside scaffold, then full frame with roof rafters).\n- `ruined`: collapsed shell, broken walls, rubble, fallen roof (use with `_damaged.png`, or `_abandoned.png` for F7 abandoned buildings).\n- `forge_l2_damaged.png`: damaged texture (scorch, holes, cracks) for the same UVs; works on every group set.\n- `forge_l2_abandoned.png`: abandoned look (damage plus moss, faded cloth, cold fires) = `abandoned_forge_l2` together with the `ruined` set or the finished set.\n\n## Clips\n\n| clip | length (s) | loop | what moves |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `working` | 1.6 | loop | `bellows` bellows pump. |\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_smoke` at (-14, 68, 0)\n- `fx_flame` at (-14, 12, -18)\n- `slot_work` at (10, 0, -30)\n- `slot_dropoff` at (-30, 0, -46)\n"},"resolution":{"width":256,"height":256},"elements":[{"name":"floor","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-48.0,0.0,-40.0],"to":[48.0,2.0,40.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,233.0,96.0,235.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[90.0,235.0,170.0,237.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,233.0,96.0,235.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[90.0,235.0,170.0,237.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,100.0,80.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[4.0,0.0,100.0,80.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"d5dc051d-8bb5-55d7-9d8b-0e2e01038190"},{"name":"furnace_a","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-30.0,2.0,-6.72],"to":[2.0,50.0,6.72],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[0.0,90.0,32.0,138.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[116.28,90.0,129.72,138.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[0.0,90.0,32.0,138.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[116.28,90.0,129.72,138.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[123.0,182.28,155.0,195.72],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[123.0,182.28,155.0,195.72],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"610bf463-3825-55fc-b2bc-18bf97342c2f"},{"name":"furnace_b","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-20.72,2.0,-16.0],"to":[-7.28,50.0,16.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,0.0,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[130.28,90.0,143.72,138.0],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[32.0,90.0,64.0,138.0],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[130.28,90.0,143.72,138.0],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[32.0,90.0,64.0,138.0],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[144.28,90.0,157.72,122.0],"texture":0},"down":